Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:03.10,KM,Walla,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:04.81,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.81,0:00:06.36,KM,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.86,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, see you on Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.03,0:00:14.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.16,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Every single time…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.49,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.62,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It’s fine, move it! I’m late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:22.50,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you working again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:23.75,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.93,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.22,0:00:41.39,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Good job today!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.39,0:00:43.94,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, is there anything you need help with?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.94,0:00:46.94,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m all right. You can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Pamphlet TS,0000,0000,0000,,Job Offers}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Title TS,0000,0000,0000,,Hanato Kobato, Private Eye}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,KM,{Pamplet TS,0000,0000,0000,,Job Offers}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:35.59,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wow…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.59,0:02:39.34,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,There are this many jobs available? {Great Recession over?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.34,0:02:42.22,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing borrowing that booklet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.04,0:02:46.93,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to work, of course! Just like Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:49.77,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So you are going to help pay\Noff at least some of the debt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.19,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.31,0:02:57.82,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll invigorate myself delivering papers in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.82,0:02:59.97,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You, who sleeps late every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.70,0:03:05.14,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,700)}Okay, then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.19,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll deliver pizza to peoples’ houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:11.19,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’ll get lost for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:17.25,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,394)}Th-Then…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.21,0:03:20.80,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll help the professional movers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:23.03,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’d screw that up by\Nbreaking vases and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.68,0:03:29.10,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then what kind of work can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:30.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.81,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That’s it! I’m through!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.19,0:03:36.78,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.61,0:03:40.32,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.74,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.20,0:03:44.32,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.32,0:03:46.28,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He’s torn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.53,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:48.99,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.10,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,It’s no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.42,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Here, all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.79,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:56.25,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.25,0:03:59.34,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I have one more thing to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.47,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:05.68,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! You’re the one who gave me the umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.68,0:04:07.55,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I know you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.29,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for your help that day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.06,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,You’re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.19,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my, you two already know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:17.13,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Once again, I’m Ueda, the shop owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.30,0:04:19.00,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m Hanato Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:25.57,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san lives in our apartment and\Nnormally helps out at Yomogi Preschool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.03,0:04:30.45,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Right now she’s looking for a place to work, so I thought of this shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.45,0:04:32.25,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:37.12,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,If you can give us a hand on the weekends when we’re busy, that would be great. {Whoo-hoo! F-cups is back!}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.12,0:04:38.71,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,At least until my hands heal up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:42.05,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,They’re this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.53,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever happened to you? {wait, where are my F-cups?}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.53,0:04:47.49,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, sometimes I can get really clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:51.18,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like she injured herself the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.19,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:57.44,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. But this puts my boss in a bind when we’re busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:59.82,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,So I’m counting on you, Kobato-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:03.82,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I look forward to working here, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.82,0:05:05.70,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And... um…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.15,0:05:10.20,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,My name is Oumura Yumi.\NNice to have you, Kobato-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.66,KM,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,All right, good luck, Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.66,0:05:15.62,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.25,0:05:22.00,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ve changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:28.14,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank goodness! The uniform fits perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.14,0:05:30.64,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Now, what would you have me do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:36.56,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well… first you say “welcome” to any customers that come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:38.33,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.33,0:05:40.06,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,J-Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:40.93,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.93,0:05:43.03,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then, when you hear their orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.03,0:05:45.99,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,you put the cakes in those boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:46.90,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,You mean these?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:50.37,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I will open up the register and take their payment…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.37,0:05:52.78,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,“Thank you very much!” Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:54.58,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,That’s right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:56.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.56,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.56,0:06:00.83,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let’s see how it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:01.79,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.21,0:06:08.30,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see… shortcake and… \Na Mont Blanc. Then I’ll have…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.30,0:06:11.39,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake… a Mont Blanc…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.38,0:06:12.72,KO,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,The cheesecake… no the apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:14.01,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Cheesecake… apple pie…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:15.14,KO,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Then I’ll have the lemon tart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:16.31,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Lemon…? Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.31,0:06:18.75,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll also have the chou à la crème too. {creme puffs? -z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.14,0:06:21.15,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Uh… um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:26.07,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shortcake, a Mont Blanc, apple pie, a lemon tart and a chou à la crème.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:27.90,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s amazing, Yumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:29.70,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, can you put them in a box?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:30.45,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:33.74,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Let’s see, shortcake and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.74,0:06:35.83,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.83,0:06:38.58,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down, just get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:39.50,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.42,0:06:45.13,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.13,0:06:46.92,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.45,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Now we need the Mont Blanc and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.45,0:06:56.45,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,…apple pie, lemon tart and chou à la crème.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.19,0:07:03.02,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,All done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.52,0:07:05.65,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Now for the finishing touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:11.03,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:13.45,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, you perky clerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.41,0:07:17.97,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did I do well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:21.21,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! You’ll be fine once you get the hang of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.83,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:23.21,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.21,0:07:25.21,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.21,0:07:28.51,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan and her mother! Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.51,0:07:29.67,KM,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Why hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.67,0:07:32.18,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,So you’re a cake-shop keeper, Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.68,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Today I’m a cake-shop keeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:35.64,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.93,0:07:37.35,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of cake do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:40.83,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Today we’re getting my birthday cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:45.23,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, it’s your birthday?! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:47.36,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, could you package it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:47.90,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.95,0:07:53.03,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,If you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.03,0:07:53.82,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:07:58.16,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.16,0:08:00.12,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:02.66,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:05.00,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:06.08,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:14.30,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.30,0:08:14.93,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:18.68,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how this happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.68,0:08:20.89,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,We must have given her the wrong cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:24.23,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll go after Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.69,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Marina-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.46,KM,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.07,0:08:32.61,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:35.07,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.07,0:08:36.36,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll have this and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.36,0:08:37.12,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:40.99,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, this customer had the Mont Blanc and cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:43.21,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.42,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:51.84,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, good job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:54.42,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, good job today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.42,0:08:56.47,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Here, you can have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.55,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:00.81,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi-san will be pleased!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:01.81,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Io…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.81,0:09:03.93,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He’s a stuffed animal in public.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:04.48,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.23,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I look forward to seeing you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:09.77,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you mean it? I can come back tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.77,0:09:11.94,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:14.28,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You can go home too, Yumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.28,0:09:17.09,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, but what about the clean-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.09,0:09:19.45,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll take care of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:21.29,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And you still haven't healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.81,KM,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's not overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:25.75,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.96,0:09:30.50,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, boss, I’m leav{\fscx200}-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:37.45,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m leaving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:41.01,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,All right, good job today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.64,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:50.36,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.19,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:55.28,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Yumi-san, you seem \Npreoccupied about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:59.20,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I’m just worried about my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.20,0:10:00.82,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Our boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.03,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,He seems troubled by something. {his dead dutch wife, er, persocom?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:09.04,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I tried asking him once,\Nbut he just said it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:11.13,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.25,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,The shop is doing well too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:17.01,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Then I wonder what exactly is troubling our boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.09,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He’s probably in debt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.09,0:10:20.76,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:23.76,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yomogi Preschool is in a lot of trouble over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.76,0:10:28.02,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, are you working for us because of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:28.89,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.89,0:10:29.81,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,How admirable…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:36.30,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Sayaka-sensei and Fujimoto-san are much more admirable than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.30,0:10:39.07,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That's why I have to help them out, even if it isn’t much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.57,0:10:45.83,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I also want to help my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.04,0:10:51.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is really good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:57.34,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Not being able to help someone even though you want to must be hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:11:01.05,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I will investigate what is troubling our boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.05,0:11:05.60,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, that’s good and all, but step out of bounds and you’ll get fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.87,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Then I won’t be able to eat\Nany more of these tasty cakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.02,0:11:12.02,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But then, there are a whole lot of other places you could work at.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.56,0:11:14.69,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Sushi bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:16.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Steak houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.69,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,350)}Chinese gourmet places!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:23.12,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, what job are you planning on next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:26.24,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m still going to work at the cake shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.04,0:11:32.40,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.83,0:11:34.79,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.79,0:11:36.42,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:39.01,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Could you line up these cookies on the shelf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.01,0:11:39.40,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.81,0:11:49.14,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I’ll leave it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:53.85,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Did he just look at me and sigh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.85,0:11:55.98,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.98,0:11:57.36,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:02.36,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Is the boss troubled… over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:22.77,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I will go ask our boss what is troubling him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.77,0:12:23.43,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:25.11,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let me handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.11,0:12:28.81,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Then, could you do it casually?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.64,0:12:32.14,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I will do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:48.78,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:50.70,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.04,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Um… actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.17,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I want to ask you something nonchalantly! {sigh…}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.54,0:12:58.17,KT,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan…!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.50,0:13:00.67,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.96,0:13:04.99,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,There must be something troubling you, am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:09.87,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t you worry. There’s nothing troubling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.87,0:13:10.56,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:17.19,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-san told me that sometimes you’re lost in thought, that you want to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.81,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,That it’s so strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:23.49,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,There is nothing for\NYumi-chan to be worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:25.67,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,That’s what he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:28.99,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,If that’s what he told you, then I\Nguess I was worrying over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.61,0:13:31.89,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.89,0:13:32.45,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.45,0:13:33.91,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.91,0:13:35.46,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.46,0:13:36.92,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.02,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,She’s here to help out until I’m healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:41.80,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.46,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you here to get a cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:46.01,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I’m going to go visit Chitose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.01,0:13:47.72,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I’d buy her a treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:51.72,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s been a while since I had a Chiroru cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:57.23,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I’m pretty sure I took your order\Nfor your husband’s birthday cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:13:59.85,KM,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.28,0:14:09.49,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei’s husband…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:12.09,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That would mean she got married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:15.08,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I’ve never seen him for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.08,0:14:16.89,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then that means they’ve split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.75,0:14:24.21,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-sensei seemed so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:27.80,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t ask her point-blank about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.26,0:14:29.76,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:32.26,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She probably doesn’t want to talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.89,0:14:37.31,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Even you aren’t saying that you’re\Nworking for Yomogi Preschool’s sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.31,0:14:40.40,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Nobody spills the beans\Nabout absolutely everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.19,0:14:45.82,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Our boss at Chiroru must be just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:49.99,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But Yumi-san wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.99,0:14:52.57,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.57,0:14:55.70,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Then you investigate more sneakily.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:14:59.25,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Although I don’t think you’re up to the job, Dobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.00,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, I’ll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:07.71,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.88,0:15:13.76,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you are pretty sneaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:15.47,KM,Chiho(?),0000,0000,0000,,Ah, it’s Kobato-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.95,0:15:17.64,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.64,0:15:19.14,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m investigating sneakily.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.35,0:15:20.60,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.60,0:15:21.96,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Just like a detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:24.44,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.53,0:15:29.99,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,So that’s a detective? {if I see “The Lonely Town“ in there, I will facepalm myself into a coma… oh wait I see it - good night! *beeeeeeep*-lol}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.99,0:15:30.57,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:31.53,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.82,0:15:33.93,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,He investigates a whole lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.93,0:15:37.01,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Motives, alibis, evidence…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.01,0:15:40.96,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Then there are inquests,\Ngathering info, and trailing suspects!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.96,0:15:41.96,KM,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:43.54,KM,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,The two of us will help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:48.09,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! Detectives work alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:49.42,KM,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:52.84,KT,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like she’s rushing\Ndown the wrong path again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:56.30,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.14,0:16:01.02,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:04.69,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Today, I am a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.69,0:16:07.15,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:09.86,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Did you notice anything strange about Chiroru?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:11.24,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.24,0:16:13.07,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:14.16,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:16.99,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s the case of what’s\Ntroubling the shopkeeper!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.99,0:16:18.37,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,The shopkeeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.58,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Is troubled?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:21.70,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have any ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.70,0:16:24.00,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,No, even if we ask him…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.50,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Anything at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.50,0:16:30.00,KM,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Chiroru cakes are popular, so it can’t be about work…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.00,0:16:31.01,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.01,0:16:33.01,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.30,0:16:36.22,KM,Man,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, if you’ll excuse us…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:40.01,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,This is beyond maddening!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:41.77,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’ll just use my own dragnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.35,0:16:44.27,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Dragnet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.27,0:16:45.94,KM,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.27,0:16:47.90,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You think I’ll take you up on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.71,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You’re sure stingy, Genko.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.07,0:16:53.11,KM,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Only when discussing romance! Hit me with something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:56.32,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I’ll take my souvenir and my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.32,0:17:00.08,KM,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! You just came here to eat my Baumkuchen, didn’t you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:01.58,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You didn’t know already?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:02.54,KM,Genko,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.54,0:17:03.66,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Adios!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.33,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Good night!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.59,0:17:13.88,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:16.09,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.09,0:17:16.93,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:18.39,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.39,0:17:19.89,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m a detective!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:26.94,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Right now I've gathered that Chiroru cakes are popular, and that his troubles aren’t about his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:29.44,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,But he’s always giving…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.44,0:17:33.69,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,…chocolates as gifts to small kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:36.17,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,He’s always wondering about people’s health.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:41.58,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And I understand that everybody loves the cakes our boss makes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.58,0:17:44.45,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And I even received some chocolates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:47.79,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Our boss is so nice to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.59,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-san, let’s follow him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.73,0:18:12.73,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan, it’s fine. Can we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:14.69,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,But…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:16.15,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.29,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,He looks like he’s waiting for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.99,0:18:28.92,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,We can’t keep following him anymore. But still…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.67,0:18:31.21,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Someone’s coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.30,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.34,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.34,0:18:40.89,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Not a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.85,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Could it be a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:46.54,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So that’s why he won’t talk to me about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.54,0:18:48.35,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,What should I do, Kobato-chan? {You really wanna ask her?}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.35,0:18:49.81,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please calm down, Yumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:52.15,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Our boss will notice us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:52.69,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.94,0:18:58.36,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:04.99,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.99,0:19:05.91,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.49,0:19:06.87,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Boss{\fscx200}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.70,0:19:09.87,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.87,0:19:11.29,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Owweee…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.29,0:19:12.38,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.71,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.71,0:19:17.71,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,In any case, who were you meeting, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.47,0:19:22.09,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, it’s an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.68,0:19:25.72,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,For a new part-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:28.10,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,A part-timer? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:32.48,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Because I haven’t been giving\Nyou breaks on weekends, Yumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.86,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,despite Kobato-san coming to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:37.32,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Breaks?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.15,0:19:43.11,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,I thought you might be worn out. And I\Nthink you injured yourself because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:45.07,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Boss…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.07,0:19:47.12,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So you were worried about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:48.49,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:56.63,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,You’ve been working very hard, and I took it for granted. I’m very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:58.21,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don’t be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.21,0:20:03.13,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,I enjoy working with you.\NYou don’t have to give me time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:08.14,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I find pleasure in connecting with the customers who appreciate your cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.68,0:20:10.93,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And I like seeing you every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:14.15,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And... about my injuries…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.81,0:20:16.11,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.15,0:20:22.74,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,It’s very cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:24.78,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Yumi-chan, did you…?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.78,0:20:26.37,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:31.29,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I injured myself so many times because I was practicing how to make cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:36.79,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to be of more help to\Nyou, boss, so I’ve been studying…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.54,0:20:39.88,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry for keeping this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:43.67,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,Can I try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:46.80,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:01.96,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,It’s delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.96,0:21:03.53,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.91,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,The new part-timer will be starting soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.91,0:21:10.83,KM,Ueda,0000,0000,0000,,and we’ll have more time for me\Nto teach you how to make cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.33,KM,Yumi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.21,0:21:23.80,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, so you solved the case, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:26.72,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Detective Kobato\Nhas closed another case!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.18,0:21:31.26,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Her boss was able to give Yumi-san her time off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:36.77,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And Yumi-san is able to\Nhelp her boss even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:42.23,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,The two were considerate of each other’s feelings… it was a very wonderful case!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.23,0:21:43.94,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, great to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.86,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And I get to eat another Baumkuchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:49.12,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,That Baumkuchen isn’t from Chiroru.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.78,0:21:53.87,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,And you have brought back this type of treat before…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:57.54,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if this has anything to do with your dragnets?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:21:59.00,KM,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.04,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,This time you get…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:03.05,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,100 sweet points, because I got to eat cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.46,0:22:05.34,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.01,0:22:09.18,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:10.01,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.01,0:22:11.01,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I have something for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.76,0:22:14.68,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,It’s chocolate I got from my work!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:17.18,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Work? You?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:19.15,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,I’m also working very hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.15,0:22:23.82,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,So you should take some time off and go to your university, Fujimoto-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.03,0:22:28.70,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don’t see a lot of good\Ncoming out of you “working hard.”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.57,0:22:32.78,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,You’re mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.58,0:22:34.62,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:40.21,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Don’t work yourself to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.71,0:22:45.34,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does that mean you’re worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.34,0:22:46.21,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No, I’m not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.21,0:22:47.88,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.88,0:22:50.51,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, do something about that scribble on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.51,0:22:51.76,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,This is 100 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:53.60,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about? They’re scribbles, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.60,0:22:54.93,KM,Dobato,0000,0000,0000,,They are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.93,0:22:57.39,KM,'',0000,0000,0000,,Since you’re such a meanie,\NFujimoto-san, you get 50 points!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.39,0:22:58.73,KM,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,1000)} I don’t get you.
